From:=20Narasimha=20Reddy=20<ServeRAIDDriver@hcl.in>

=09The=20attached=20patch=20was=20generated=20for=20fixing=20the=20follow=
ing=20issues.=20These=20issues=20were=20reported=20by=20Cisco,=20SAP=20an=
d=20some=20other=20customers=20as=20well.

Regarding=20the=20testing=20of=20fixes:
--------------------------------

=09These=20particular=20problems=20were=20reported=20by=20Cisco=20and=20S=
AP=20and=20customers=20as=20well.=20Cisco=20reported=20on=20RHEL4=20U6=20=
and=20SAP=20reported=20on=20SLES9=20SP4=20and=20SLES10=20SP2.=20We=20adde=
d=20these=20fixes=20on=20RHEL4=20U6=20and=20gave=20a=20private=20build=20=
to=20IBM=20and=20Cisco.=20Cisco=20and=20IBM=20tested=20it=20for=20more=20=
than=2015=20days=20and=20they=20reported=20that=20they=20did=20not=20see=
=20the=20issue=20so=20far.=20Before=20the=20fix,=20Cisco=20used=20to=20se=
e=20the=20issue=20within=205=20days.=20We=20generated=20a=20patch=20for=
=20SLES9=20SP4=20and=20SLES10=20SP2=20and=20submitted=20to=20Novell.=20No=
vell=20applied=20the=20patch=20and=20gave=20a=20test=20build=20to=20SAP.=
=20SAP=20tested=20and=20reported=20that=20the=20build=20is=20working=20pr=
operly.

We=20also=20tested=20in=20our=20lab=20using=20the=20tools=20"dishogsync",=
=20which=20is=20IO=20stress=20tool=20and=20the=20tool=20was=20provided=20=
by=20Cisco.

Issue1:=20File=20System=20going=20into=20read-only=20mode
---------

Root=20cause:
-----------
=A0=A0=A0=A0=A0=A0=20The=20driver=20tends=20to=20not=20free=20the=20memor=
y=20(FIB)=20when=20the=20management=20request=20exits=20prematurely.=20Th=
e=20accumulation=20of=20such=20un-freed=20memory=20causes=20the=20driver=
=20to=20fail=20to=20allocate=20anymore=20memory=20(FIB)=20and=20hence=20r=
eturn=200x70000=20value=20to=20the=20upper=20layer,=20which=20puts=20the=
=20file=20system=20into=20read=20only=20mode.

Fix=20details:
------------
=A0=A0=A0=A0=20The=20fix=20makes=20sure=20to=20free=20the=20memory=20(FIB=
)=20even=20if=20the=20request=20exits=20prematurely=20hence=20ensuring=20=
the=20driver=20wouldn't=20run=20out=20of=20memory=20(FIBs).


Issue2:
-------=20
=09False=20Raid=20Alert=20occurs-=20when=20the=20Physical=20Drives=20and=
=20Logical=20drives=20are=20reported=20as=20deleted=20or=20added,=20even=
=20though=20there=20is=20no=20change=20done=20on=20the=20system

Root=20cause:
-----------
=A0=A0=A0=A0=A0=A0=A0=20Driver=20IOCTLs=20is=20signaled=20with=20EINTR=20=
while=20waiting=20on=20response=20from=20the=20lower=20layers.=20Returnin=
g=20"EINTR"=20will=20never=20initiate=20internal=20retry.=20

Fix=20details:
------------
=A0=A0=A0=A0=A0=A0=A0=20The=20issue=20was=20fixed=20by=20replacing=20"EIN=
TR"=20with=20"ERESTARTSYS"=20for=20mid-layer=20retries.


